this file describes the UI and its behaviors.

notes:
  - title: Satisfactory Production Planning
  - for now, make the page a simple column
  - this page should pay homage to Satisfactory styling. 
  - input type numeric should be used for number fields. If a number has bounds, like clock speed,
         the control should only accept values in that range. 
  - use a select for choice of item or power plant. name fields get normal text input.
       for collapsable controls, click to expand and collapse, and remember that state in local storage.
       multiple controls can be expanded at once.
  - display decimal values to 2 decimal places
  - for items with collapsable state, that state is saved with the save data.
  - A box is a container with a border that has a different color than its parent

COLOR PALETTE:

  Primary Colors:
    - FICSIT Orange: #FF8C00 (main accent color, buttons, highlights)
    - FICSIT Amber: #FFA500 (secondary accent, hover states)
    - FICSIT Copper: #D4772B (tertiary accent, borders)

  Background Colors:
    - Deep Space: #0A0A0A (page background)
    - Dark Panel: #1A1A1A (main containers)
    - Mid Panel: #252525 (nested containers, boxes)
    - Light Panel: #333333 (input backgrounds, collapsed items)
    - Hover Panel: #3A3A3A (hover states for containers)

  Text Colors:
    - Primary Text: #FFFFFF (main text, labels)
    - Secondary Text: #CCCCCC (secondary information)
    - Muted Text: #999999 (hints, disabled states)
    - Link Text: #FFA500 (clickable items)

  Status Colors:
    - Success Green: #4CAF50 (goals met, positive states)
    - Warning Yellow: #FFB300 (partial completion, in-progress)
    - Error Red: #F44336 (zero production, errors)
    - Info Blue: #2196F3 (informational highlights)

  Border Colors:
    - Strong Border: #FF8C00 (focused elements, important containers)
    - Medium Border: #555555 (standard containers)
    - Subtle Border: #333333 (nested divs, separators)

  Interactive Colors:
    - Button Primary: #FF8C00 (primary action buttons)
    - Button Primary Hover: #FFA500
    - Button Secondary: #555555 (secondary actions)
    - Button Secondary Hover: #666666
    - Button Danger: #F44336 (delete, remove actions)
    - Button Danger Hover: #FF5252
    - Input Focus: #FFA500 (input border when focused)

  Special Effects:
    - Shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) (box shadows, depth)
    - Glow: rgba(255, 140, 0, 0.3) (accent glows, focus states)


